    "answer": {
      "short": "$y'=1>0$ for all $x$, so the function is increasing for all $x$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y'&=1\\\\y'&>0\\quad\\text{for all }x\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore, $y=x+7$ is increasing for all $x$.",
